                          SECURITY EDUCATION NOTICE

   This software is the Blaze Vulnerable Bitcoin Exchange (BVBE), an
   intentionally vulnerable web application built by Blaze Information
   Security as authorized security education material. Security flaws
   in this codebase are deliberate and documented in VULNS.md.

   This software is provided strictly for:
     - Authorized penetration-testing training
     - Capture-the-Flag exercises
     - Blue-team detection practice
     - Security research in isolated lab environments

   You must NOT:
     - Deploy this software to a public network
     - Use it with real funds, real keys, or real personal data
     - Use techniques learned from it against systems you do not own
       or have explicit written authorization to test

